=begin

  Starts saga_hl_sagapanel. Keep this short name so ;saga-hl works.

  Usage:
    ;saga-hl                 - Start the saga-hl Saga panel
    ;saga_hl_sagapanel       - Same, run the panel directly

  Panel commands (once running): *hl help / *hl apply / *hl package …

       creator: loraque (loraque@gmail.com)
        author: loraque (loraque@gmail.com)
          game: Gemstone
          tags: saga, frontend, panel, highlights
      required: Lich >= 5.12.0
       version: 0.1.0

  changelog:
    0.1.0 (2026-10-18)
      launcher for saga_hl_sagapanel

=end

if Script.running?('saga_hl_sagapanel')
  echo 'saga-hl: panel already running — *hl help'
else
  Script.start('saga_hl_sagapanel')
end
